        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Aligned with continuous improvement, we began offering self-installable fixed products, reducing waiting times, facilitating service activation, and contributing to a more efficient cost structure.",
