        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a multi-cloud provider, we integrate major international hyperscalers and leverage our Datacenters to host edge solutions, provide world-class brand equipment, and deliver professional services for implementation, migration, and application support.",
