        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-026480",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "During 2025, Personal Tech focused most of our business on IP transit, a service demanded by ISP to provide internet connectivity to their customers across different market segments.",
        "start_character": 55122,
        "end_character": 55304
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-026480",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-026480-fe628f6f2c5e5582",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-026480",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "During 2025, we continued developing commercial strategies aimed at increasing the profitability of wholesale products, among which are the services for OTTs.",
        "start_character": 100088,
        "end_character": 100246
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-026480",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-026480-fe628f6f2c5e5582",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-026480",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "During 2025, we have provided international telecommunications services agreements with international carriers (fixed services), which cover delivery of traffic to Iran through non-Iranian carriers.",
